# Per-machine baselines live in this directory.
#
# File layout: `<PERF_MACHINE>.json`, e.g. `linux-x64-3f9c2a.json`.
# Each file is keyed `<layer>.<scenario>.<fixture>.<size> -> { median, iqr, lastUpdatedUtc, codeShaAtBaseline }`.
#
# See docs/perf.md for the file format and the `perf:baseline` workflow.
#
# Contributors seed their own baseline on first use; we do NOT ship a
# default baseline because perf characteristics are bimodal between
# laptops, desktops, and CI runners.
